1. Project Overview
NK SkillEdge Pvt. Ltd. currently operates an informational corporate website (nkskilledge.com) containing company information, leadership profiles, services, training programs, projects, success stories, team details, and contact information.
This PRD defines the requirements for renewing that website into a modern, scalable, and professionally structured digital platform that represents NK SkillEdge as an established IT training, skill-development, and software-development organization.
The new platform is not a like-for-like reproduction of the old website. It must materially improve the following dimensions:
•Brand presentation
•User experience
•Content organization
•Website performance
•Search engine optimization (SEO)
•Lead generation
•Training registrations
•Project and service inquiries
•Content management
•Administrative control
•Mobile responsiveness
•Security
•Analytics
•Scalability
The system must be architected so that future features and modules can be added incrementally, without requiring a rebuild of the core application.
