35. Backend Architecture
Recommended architecture: Node.js + Express.js.
Client → Frontend → REST API → Node.js/Express.js → Controllers → Services → Models → MongoDB
Recommended backend layers:
•Routes
•Controllers
•Services
•Models
•Middleware
•Validators
•Utilities
•Authentication
•Configuration
•Logging
A modular architecture is required; business logic must not be placed directly in route files.
